  "abstract": "This experiment aims to improve upon the SOTA 4-expert MoE model (ID 65) through hyperparameter tuning. The hypothesis is that the default learning rate of 0.001 is not optimal for this architecture. By reducing the learning rate to 0.0003, this submission tests if a finer, more stable training process can lead the model to a better convergence point and achieve a new SOTA score.",
